ImPlot is an immediate mode, GPU accelerated plotting library for Dear
ImGui. It offers line, scatter, bar, shaded, stem, stair, error bar,
heatmap, histogram, pie and digital plots, with pan, zoom, multiple axes,
time axes, legends and drag tools, in the same style as ImGui's widgets.

This package builds it as a library, static and shared, against the
devel/imgui package, with a pkg-config file (implot, which requires
imgui). The library includes the demo window, ImPlot::ShowDemoWindow().
